const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文记录加密货币拉升出货事件的价格、成交量、波动和参与者相关模式。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"The paper documents price, volume, volatility, and participant-related patterns around cryptocurrency pump-and-dump events. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1017/s0022109025000201",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"来源将事件识别、市场观测和钱包级资料结合，并利用平台政策变化讨论相关市场后果。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It combines event identification, market observations, wallet-level material, and platform-policy changes to discuss market consequences. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1017/s0022109025000201",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要事件时间戳、公开消息或识别规则、代币和场所身份、价格成交量、钱包数据及政策变更时点。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"Use event timestamps, public messages or identification rules, token and venue identity, prices and volume, wallet data, and policy-change timing. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1017/s0022109025000201",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"摘要描述短期剧烈变动和快速反转等历史事件特征；它不提供实时事件识别器，也不把所有异常成交归为操纵。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The abstract describes historical short-lived moves and reversals; it does not provide a real-time detector or classify every unusual trade as manipulation. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not convert association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1017/s0022109025000201",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"记录事件定义和所有纳入排除规则，冻结场所与代币范围，核对消息时钟和市场时钟，并区分钱包标签与已验证身份。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Record event definition and all inclusion rules; freeze venue and token scope; reconcile message and market clocks; distinguish labels from verified identity. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1017/s0022109025000201",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025)。加密市场的覆盖、洗售和消息可见性限制很强；该导读不作执法结论、风险评级或交易建议。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025). Coverage, wash trading, and message visibility constrain crypto evidence; this guide makes no enforcement conclusion, risk rating, or trading recommendation. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1017/s0022109025000201",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial and Quantitative Analysis (2025) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Cryptocurrency Pump-and-Dump Schemes”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。加密市场的覆盖、洗售和消息可见性限制很强；该导读不作执法结论、风险评级或交易建议。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Cryptocurrency Pump-and-Dump Schemes”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
